WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.601
-Welcome back
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.467
We're about to play a game
of "Catch Phrase,"

00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:06.701
but Tariq and I need partners.

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.167
Tariq, we found
a great one for you.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.400
You can see her on
the Emmy-winning drama series

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.801
"Westworld," which returns for
its fourth season on Sunday,

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:17.000
June 26th on HBO and HBO max.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.834
Please welcome Evan Rachel Wood!

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:21.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.934
Are you kidding me?
Come on.

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:25.901
-Nice to see you.
-Good to meet you.

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.434
Always the best to see you,
buddy.

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:30.868
Welcome.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.000
-My partner's new album,
"Superache,"

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.300
is out later tonight.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.934
Give it up for Conan Gray,
everyone!

00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:39.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:43.934
You feeling good?
-Feeling good.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:47.200
Now here's how the game works.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.767
Evan, you will start the round
by pressing start

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:50.934
on this buzzer right here.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:52.501
You draw a clue
from the top of the pile.

00:00:52.501 --> 00:00:53.801
You have to get your partner
to guess the clue

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:55.067
as quickly as possible,

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:57.634
then hand the buzzer off
to the person on your...

00:00:57.634 --> 00:00:59.100
-Right.
-Right.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.267
-Yeah, you can make any physical
gesture, say whatever you want,

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.601
except you can't say any word
in the actual clue.

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:04.901
If you're holding the buzzer
when it goes off,

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.300
your team loses that round.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.567
We're gonna play three rounds.
Let's take our positions.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.000
Conan, you're over there, bud.
-All right.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.501
-Am I here?
-Yeah.

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:13.467
Oh, you're over here?
-I think I'm here.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:14.934
Evan, you're over there.
-I'm here?

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.033
-You're over on this side.
-Okay.

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.167
-All right, yeah.
-Uh-huh.

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:18.434
-All right.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.767
All right, Evan, I'm gonna
give this to you, bud.

00:01:20.767 --> 00:01:23.067
Whenever you're ready, you press
start, draw your clue.

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:24.634
You feel like you have
a connection with Tariq?

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:26.834
-Yes. We're locked in.
-We got this.

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.033
-We're pards.
We're pards.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.133
Right there.
Come on.

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.234
Double fist.
-Yeah.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:31.234
-Double fist bump.

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:32.300
All right,
whenever you're ready.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.067
Press start,
and then draw the clue.

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:35.434
[ Intermittent beeping ]

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.934
-Okay.
Um, um, um, uh...

00:01:38.934 --> 00:01:40.033
"Ghostbusters."

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.100
It's a pastry
with filling inside.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.701
It's, like, yellow.
-Pop-Tart.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:45.968
-No, it's yellow and round
and kind of -- you know --

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:47.434
-[ Stammering ]

00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:50.100
-"Ghostbusters."
-"Ghostbusters."

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.534
-Hostess.
-Oh, Twinkies!

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:53.501
-Yes!
-All right, okay.

00:01:53.501 --> 00:01:55.834
Uh, uh, uh, uh, Fourth of July!
Pwkk!

00:01:55.834 --> 00:01:57.367
-Fireworks.
-Yes.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:02.400
-Okay, a team has an animal
who represents them

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.567
and they're called the --
-A team -- a mascot.

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:07.400
-Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.200
-Oh, "Star Wars."
-Lightsaber.

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.767
-Use the Force.
-Darth Vader.

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:13.701
-Another one.
-"Star Trek."

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:15.601
-No, no, no.
Oh, God, he has --

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.400
-Luke Skywalker.
-No, no, no.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.434
-Yoda.
-No, no, no.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:19.667
One more, one more.
-Baby Yoda!

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.000
Chewbacca!
Han Solo!

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.567
-Three words, three words!
Obi-Wan Kenobi!

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:25.801
-That's it!
-Oh!

00:02:25.801 --> 00:02:27.367
-Oh, my God.
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:27.367 --> 00:02:29.834
-Wow!
-First of all...

00:02:29.834 --> 00:02:31.400
[ Laughter ]
First of all...

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.334
-All right.
That doesn't count.

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:37.334
-He blocked him!

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:40.234
-I read eight characters
from "Star Wars."

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:42.367
[ Laughter ]
I didn't know what --

00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:44.100
Princess Leia is
the only person I didn't say.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.801
Oh, my goodness!
That was fantastic.

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:47.701
-Absolutely counts.
-It absolutely counts.

00:02:47.701 --> 00:02:49.467
All right, we're -- hoo!
That was --

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:51.300
I'm sweating, I'm sweating.
Okay. Here we go.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.667
-Wow.
-All right. Here we go.

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:54.133
So it's one.
That's good.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:57.467
We're gonna play three rounds.
Okay, you can start off again.

00:02:57.467 --> 00:02:58.567
Clue number 6.
Here we go.

00:02:58.567 --> 00:03:01.067
-All right.
[ Beeping ]

00:03:01.067 --> 00:03:02.601
Oh!
You throw it and somebody --

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:03.734
-Frisbee.
-Yeah.

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.267
-Wow.
All right. Okay.

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:08.601
Okay.
It's not a strawberry daiquiri,

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:12.400
it's a coconut --
it's a frozen drink.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.400
-Oh, my God, I don't even drink.
-I know.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.601
-Coconut?
-That song --

00:03:16.601 --> 00:03:18.734
♪ If you like -- ♪
-Piña coladas!

00:03:18.734 --> 00:03:20.601
-Wow!
-Thank you, thank you!

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:22.601
-It's a game you play where you
go around in a circle.

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:23.868
It's bird names.

00:03:23.868 --> 00:03:26.467
This bird, this bird,
and then a different bird.

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:28.801
It's like, you go -- people --
you walk around in a circle.

00:03:28.801 --> 00:03:30.133
Uh, okay, um...

00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:31.167
-Duck, Duck, Goose!
-Yes!

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:33.167
-Oh, my God!
-Oh, my God!

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:34.968
-This bird.
-Oh, my God.

00:03:34.968 --> 00:03:37.501
It's a -- oh, my God.
It's made out of --

00:03:37.501 --> 00:03:39.234
It's like lobster,
and it's made into, like,

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:40.934
